@model ReformedHistory.Views.Content.Confessions.Secret.SecretSection

<h2 id="@this.Model.Link">Chapter @this.Model.Index</h2>
<h3>@this.Model.Name</h3>
<br />

<div class="centerQuote">
    <span>
        Surely Your goodness and mercy shall follow me all the days of my life,
        and I shall dwell in the house of the LORD forever
    </span>
    <span>King David, Psalm 23</span>
</div>
    
<ol>
    <li>
        The Lord God is good, and His love endures forever throughout all generations. He is the Lord, the one true 
        and holy God, who is compassionate and gracious, slow to anger and abounding in love and faithfulness
        <a href="#@(this.Model.Link).Sources.1">(@(this.Model.Index).1)</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
        And God so loved the world that he gave his only-begotten Son, Jesus Christ, to ransom the world from sin,
        death, and the devil, so that whoever believes in Him shall not perish but have eternal life
        <a href="#@(this.Model.Link).Sources.2">(@(this.Model.Index).2)</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
        God is patient and forbearing, desiring the repentance and salvation of all men 
        <a href="#@(this.Model.Link).Sources.3">(@(this.Model.Index).3)</a>.
    </li>
</ol>
<br />